      "remarks": "Declared framework: HIPAA Security Rule. Catalog source: NIST SP 800-66 Rev. 2 with 45 CFR 164.x citations as props. GAP-06 (reserved concurrency / DLQ / X-Ray) is deliberately not implemented: it has no HIPAA citation and FRAMEWORKS.md forbids a policy whose primary control comes from an undeclared framework. Evidence props and the evidence link are filled from the pipeline's receipt.json by scripts/oscal-fill-evidence.sh."
    },
